An unofficial reimplementation, for Horizon, of the behaviour of two Minecraft mods written in Java.
No Java code, texture, model or text of either original is included in this repository at this version.
No code, asset or text of Mojang or Microsoft is included.

1. Arrow Trails
   Copyright (c) 2025 Biverom. MIT License: LICENSES/arrowtrails-MIT.txt
   Source: https://github.com/Biverom/arrowtrails, commit d94f3866bbf33241e57e1166f7bd5351dbded68f
   Derived here: behaviour descriptions and default values documented in docs/ANALYSIS.md
   (trail lengths, colours, alphas, widths, kind precedence, ribbon algorithm). Nothing implemented yet.

2. Real Arrow Tip
   MIT License, as published: LICENSES/real-arrow-tip-MIT.txt
   (its copyright line reads "Copyright (c) 2023 " with no holder name; the project is by ToBinio,
   source headers name Tobias Frischmann).
   Source: https://tangled.org/tobinio.dev/real-arrow-tip, commit e2033a0d81e91a218bb0fce13f2aefc45abe3f6b
   Derived here: behaviour descriptions documented in docs/ANALYSIS.md (which model each projectile
   selects, multishot rule, default tint 0xFF385DC6). Nothing implemented yet.
   Its textures are NOT used: they appear to contain Mojang artwork (docs/RISKS.md).

Each later file derived from either original will be listed here with its origin.
